WEBVTT

00:03:56.663 --> 00:04:00.496
Or what if instead of a structure that
passively soaked up all the star’s energy,

00:04:00.538 --> 00:04:01.538
like a plant,

00:04:01.579 --> 00:04:05.329
an alien civilization built one that
actively sucked the energy out of the star

00:04:05.371 --> 00:04:07.871
like a hummingbird.

00:04:09.538 --> 00:04:13.454
Frighteningly enough, we've observed
super dense celestial bodies

00:04:13.496 --> 00:04:14.788
about the size of a planet

00:04:14.829 --> 00:04:17.996
that drain energy
out of a much bigger star.

00:04:18.038 --> 00:04:19.871
It’d be much too premature to conclude

00:04:19.913 --> 00:04:21.829
this is evidence
of life in the universe.

00:04:21.871 --> 00:04:24.204
There are also explanations
for these observations

00:04:24.246 --> 00:04:26.996
that don't involve alien life forms.

00:04:27.038 --> 00:04:31.288
But that doesn't stop us
from asking, "What if?"